     HHHHOOOOKKSS__RRUUNN__IIFF() macro, but performs an additional step to look up the
     _s_t_r_u_c_t _h_h_o_o_k___h_e_a_d for the specified _h_o_o_k___t_y_p_e and _h_o_o_k___i_d identifiers.
     It should not be used except in code paths which are infrequently exe‐
