     a rmlock(9).  Therefore, anytime hhhhooookk__rruunn__hhooookkss() is called directly or
     indirectly via the HHHHOOOOKKSS__RRUUNN__IIFF() or HHHHOOOOKKSS__RRUUNN__IIFF__LLOOOOKKUUPP() macros, a
     non-sleepable read lock will be acquired and held across the calls to all
